OL,3,GNEWSA'Unbelievable pong' plagues
OL,4,Aholiday park for years
OL,5,
OL,6,FOngoing problems with an "unbelievable
OL,7,Fpong" at a holiday park have led to
OL,8,Fcriticism of a utility company for not
OL,9,Fdoing enough to tackle the issue.
OL,11,FBosses at Lady's Mile Holiday Park in
OL,12,FDawlish Warren, Devon, complained a
OL,13,Fsewage smell occurred intermittently in
OL,14,Fpart of the site, forcing some visitors
OL,15,Fto leave when it arose.
OL,17,FPark operations manager Stephen Brown
OL,18,Fsaid the business had contacted South
OL,19,FWest Water about the problem over a
OL,20,Fnumber of years but the issue had been
OL,21,F"ignored".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
