OL,3,GNEWSA'Unbelievable pong' plagues
OL,4,Aholiday park for years
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Water said in a statement
OL,7,Fwork at a treatment works in the area
OL,8,Fhad caused "some temporary smells" but
OL,9,Fit had also investigated the
OL,10,Fpossibility the smell could be coming
OL,11,Ffrom elsewhere.
